[en.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_ENSLAVE]
Zeal of the Convert

[en.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_ENSLAVE_desc]
It should come as no surprise that faith is a powerful force. Those heretics who have fallen to the shadow of fear often prove more loyal and driven than the Umbrum soldiers and the Empire’s original slaves.

[zh.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_ENSLAVE]
皈依的狂热

[zh.IDEA_C15_SOMBRA_FAITH_ENSLAVE_desc]
毫不意外的是，信仰是一种强大的力量。在拜倒于恐惧的暗影之后，那些皈依的异教徒往往会比荒原影魔士兵和帝国原本的奴隶更加忠诚和充满干劲。
